First, from the report and code you provided, the problem is that `WebGLTileLayer` has no `setStyle()` method — you must fully recreate the layer in order to change its style (color, contrast, gamma, etc.).  We’ll add a `setStyle()` API very similar to the existing `updateStyleVariables()` method.  This will:

1. Replace the layer’s saved `style_` object (including its `variables`)  
2. Trigger a re-render via `changed()`  

